{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415810","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415810","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041581001:1":{"text":"이봐, 트라이브 친구! 팔에 찬 건 손목 보호대인가? 건틀릿은 어디다 두고?","source_cn":"嘿，那位蛮血朋友！你手臂上的是护腕吗？你的拳套去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3AA6030198403FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041581002:1":{"text":"건틀릿? 난 그런 거 없는데.","source_cn":"拳套？我没有拳套啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79440DE1A9941F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041581003:1":{"text":"팔에 찬 거? 어... 내 스케일메일? 뭐, 손목 보호대라고 해도 딱히 틀린 말은 아니지.","source_cn":"至于手臂上的……你说的是这两块鳞甲吧？说是护腕应该也没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9736896462976BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041581004:1":{"text":"아! 미안, 미안! 난 또 너도 나처럼 주먹 좀 쓰는 레슬러인 줄 알았지.","source_cn":"噢！抱歉抱歉，我还以为你也和我一样，是个擅长用拳的摔角手呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46A677E29C6E86BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041581005:1":{"text":"그래? 내가 레슬러처럼 보이구나!","source_cn":"是吗？原来我看起来很像摔角手啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32F90A5CA1119D21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041581006:1":{"text":"하지만 아쉽게도 내 실력은 그렇게 뛰어나지 않아. 이 스케일메일이 아니었다면 사막에서 살아남기는커녕, 위기에 처한 우르 부족을 구해내지도 못했을 거야.","source_cn":"可惜我的武技其实不算很出众。要不是有这身还算坚硬的鳞甲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x709823EDE6E1D790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041581007:1":{"text":"레슬링 상대를 찾고 있던 거라면 실망시켰겠네. 미안.","source_cn":"如果你是在找摔角对手的话，可能要让你失望了，抱歉啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0E79EFC37DCE043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041581008:1":{"text":"아니, 아니, 그런 말 하지 마.","source_cn":"不不不，不要这样说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6027097E86B7DA40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041581009:1":{"text":"너처럼 젊고 강한 데다 뛰어난 재능까지 타고났으면서, 왜 그렇게 자신을 낮추는 거야?","source_cn":"像你这么年轻又坚毅的孩子，还与生俱来这么出众的天赋，怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE2E78C05208E5F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041581010:1":{"text":"비록 나는 사막에 가 본 적은 없지만, 그런 환경에서 살아가는 게 얼마나 고된지는 들어서 알고 있어. 넌 이미 네 힘을 증명했다고!","source_cn":"我虽然没有去过沙漠，但也听说过生活在那种环境下有多艰苦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9EFDBDF95240ACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041581011:1":{"text":"“진짜 보석은 진흙 속에서도 빛나는 법!” 넌 그저 우연히 사막에서 태어나, 거센 모래바람에 잠시 빛이 가려져 있을 뿐이야!","source_cn":"“是金子总会发光”！你只是恰巧生在沙漠里，被漫天的沙子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B866B8F7BC304EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041581012:1":{"text":"크흠... 칭찬해 줘서 고마워... 이렇게 칭찬해 주는 사람은 거의 없었거든.","source_cn":"咳咳……谢谢你的夸奖……很少有人这么夸奖我呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBEF6D10958CEAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041581013:1":{"text":"네 말이 맞을지도 모르겠네. 나도 사막을 떠나 여행을 한번 해 봐야겠어. 어, 물론 그전에 우르 부족의 일을 전부 정리해 둬야겠지만.","source_cn":"也许你说得对，我该离开沙漠外出旅行一趟——呃，不过要先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8587802C22D35134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041581014:1":{"text":"그때가 되면 와일더스의 땅에도 한번 가 볼 수 있겠네!","source_cn":"到时候，我可以去绿裔的领地上看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB056A3D2D294065F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041581015:1":{"text":"하하, 그럼 약속한 거다? 내가 마중 나갈게!","source_cn":"哈哈，那就一言为定！我会去迎接你的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D061B91B481DDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041581016:1":{"text":"나중에 너한테 레슬링 재능이 있다는 걸 알게 되면, 그때 나랑 화끈하게 한판 붙는 거다!","source_cn":"要是到时你发现了自己的摔角天赋，千万别忘了和我痛快地比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9728524CD14B7F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:坦布尔":{"text":"브록","source":"坦布尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}